    "type": "game",
    "name": "Solve or Die",
    "steam_appid": 3706150,
    "required_age": 0,
    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective who investigates cases no one else dares to touch. From your investigation hub, choose from a set of\u00a0eerie cases \u2014 each with its own location, puzzles and danger. <br> <br>Use your instincts to hide, crack each puzzle - and survive long enough to escape, even if it means descending into the ghost world itself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics and minimal interface will drag you deeper into each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.poster.avif?t=1750792641\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.webm?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.mp4?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers a new variation.\u00a0Puzzles, key items, and interactions change with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.poster.avif?t=1750792641\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.webm?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.mp4?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental hiding and escape mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid danger by hiding in closets or escaping through climbable ladders. Ladders can be placed in specific spots, letting you create your own escape paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the ritual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cursed objects to perform the final ritual, stop the haunting, and survive the case.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Step into the role of a detective who investigates cases no one else dares to touch. From your investigation hub, choose from a set of\u00a0eerie cases \u2014 each with its own location, puzzles and danger. <br> <br>Use your instincts to hide, crack each puzzle - and survive long enough to escape, even if it means descending into the ghost world itself. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Immersive experience</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Realistic graphics and minimal interface will drag you deeper into each encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.poster.avif?t=1750792641\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.webm?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/05998766bb7d933d89b169d0b01ee34c.mp4?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Challenging gameplay</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each playthrough offers a new variation.\u00a0Puzzles, key items, and interactions change with every run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.poster.avif?t=1750792641\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.webm?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3706150/extras/4db6eb10f3c4254f26bf9578395a1402.mp4?t=1750792641\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Environmental hiding and escape mechanics</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid danger by hiding in closets or escaping through climbable ladders. Ladders can be placed in specific spots, letting you create your own escape paths.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Complete the ritual</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use cursed objects to perform the final ritual, stop the haunting, and survive the case.</p>",
    "short_description": "Solve or Die is a first-person detective horror game. Face cursed cases, hide or run from terrifying entities, solve deadly puzzles, and complete rituals before you\u2019re taken by the darkness.",
